fcitx5-slm-ime (1.1.0) unstable; urgency=low

  * The model is trained on FineWeb-2 (Japanese web pages) besides the Japanese
    Wikipedia: the character error rate on web text falls from 7.25 % to 4.89 %.
  * The candidates from Anthy are put in order by the model, after the text before
    the phrasal unit, and are fetched in the background.
  * The last characters of a long conversion are no longer cut off.
  * Without the text before the cursor from the application, the engine sends the
    text committed before; Ctrl+Shift+Insert takes the last commit back.

 -- Osamu Ogasawara <osamu.ogasawara@gmail.com>  Fri, 30 Oct 2026 22:00:00 +0900

